  "description": "Construction of substation within the service yard of Arches 417-420 Richmond Road.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;Noise levels from the substation shall be 10dB(A) or more below the background noise level when measured at 1m from any nearby noise sensitive premises at any time. The scheme shall be implemented in accordance with the approved details and attenuation measures, and they shall be permanently retained and maintained in working order for the duration of the use and their operation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Should any changes to the approved plant or equipment occur, a noise assessment must be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority to demonstrate compliance with BS4142:2014+A1:2019.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To safeguard the amenity of neighbouring occupiers and ensure compliance with Policy LP2 of Hackney’s Local Plan and the London Plan’s strategic noise policies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
